<title>SPAIN: Spain's Ence says Q3 loss 566 mln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Ence says Q3 loss 566 mln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish paper firm Ence said on Friday it had posted a loss of 566 million pesetas in the three months to end-September 1996.</p>
<p>A spokesman for the firm said it could not provide details on results for the year to date.</p>
<p>According to figures announced by Ence earlier this year, accumulated losses for the first nine months of the year total 2.86 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Turnover between July and September was 9.94 billion pesetas, Ence said in a note.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
